"26. Allowing the appeal and setting aside the orders,
 this Court stated;
 "It is unrealistic to expect the appellant company to  resist a claim at the first instance on the basis of the  fraud because appellant company had at that stage no  knowledge about the fraud allegedly played by the  claimants.

Therefore, I pass the following:
 ORDER a) Writ Petition No.11578 of 2022 allowed;
